    <description>Scheduled Flow diario BULKIFICADO. Para Opportunities com Contratacao_Publica__c = true e nao fechadas, quando Data_Limite_Entrega__c esta a 30, 15 ou 7 dias: notifica in-app (sino + push) o Owner e o Director da BU (CMT SC_BU_Director__mdt) e cria UMA tarefa ao Owner por concurso (dedup por WhatId + Subject + tarefa aberta). Zero SOQL/DML dentro do loop: directores, tarefas existentes e CNT lidos ANTES do loop; updates e creates em massa DEPOIS do loop. Sem email (politica in-app + tarefas).</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>forFaultMsg</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;SC_Opportunity_AlertaDeadline falhou na gravacao em massa | &quot; &amp; {!$Flow.FaultMessage}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>formulaDate30</name>
        <dataType>Date</dataType>
        <expression>TODAY() + 30</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>formulaDiasRestantes</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>DATEVALUE({!varCurrentOpp.Data_Limite_Entrega__c}) - TODAY()</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>formulaNotifBody</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Concurso &quot; &amp; {!varCurrentOpp.Name} &amp; &quot;: prazo de entrega a &quot; &amp; TEXT({!formulaDiasRestantes}) &amp; &quot; dias&quot;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>formulaTaskSubject</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Concurso &quot; &amp; {!varCurrentOpp.Name} &amp; &quot;: preparar e submeter proposta&quot;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>formulaToday</name>
        <dataType>Date</dataType>
        <expression>TODAY()</expression>
    </formulas>
